<title>UK: LME copper ends kerb barely changed, nickel at low.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends kerb barely changed, nickel at low.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends just $1 firmer at $2,529, eases off fresh one-year highs during PM kerb.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ends at day's lows of $7,200, off $80. Depressed by news of tentative contract agreement at Inco.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Just easier. TIN - Below $5,600. ZINC - Down.</p>
</text>
